category: Science
requires: bash cygwin libduktape207 libgcc1 libGL1 libGLEW2.1 libglfw3 libgomp1 libintl8 liblinenoise0 liblodepng0 libstdc++6
sdesc: "Voronoi diagram-based tool to find atom contacts"
ldesc: "Voronota is a software tool for analyzing three-dimensional structures of
biological macromolecules using the Voronoi diagram of atomic balls."

